{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267kBv5BMEM61794365392.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>女西醫蔡淑梅涉嫌濫發逾萬張「免針紙」，案件今日宣判。</p><p></p><p>蔡淑梅早上抵達區域法院聽取判決。</p><p></p><p>案情指，被告在元朗開診所在不具精神科或心理學專業資格下，涉嫌2022年在8個月內濫發約1.2萬張「免針紙」，多以疫苗恐懼症為理由，被控17項不誠實地取用電腦罪。她同丈夫同時被控7項洗黑錢罪，涉款逾760萬元。兩人否認全部控罪。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.119264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:10.298657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:10.298657+00:00","content_hash":"2f3e49cd9d4175f326536952e77790e73afc6337c5a435788d728818345947ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}